              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chochina atiyapeni chitiyaŋenu chawu muBerisheba. Abimeleki wanyamukili kwindi, niFwikoli mukulumpi wamashidikindi, hiyakufunta cheŋi ni mwituŋa dawaFwilistinu.",
          "type": "text",
