        {
          "text": "Abarahama watumbili mutondu watamarisiki muBerisheba, kwenoku watambikili niijina daYehova, Nzambi Wahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.33",
